# Rezbit rez6 (spec tools/cov/specs/rezbit_force4.py): loader unknown-property arms and the ctor with an invalid
# effect / derez model happen at the layer loads; here the BecomeRezzed / BecomeDeRezzed states in both rez states,
# `spawn REZB` without an ANCS (LoadRezbit's model-null return), then both Rezbits are killed (dtor arms).
@f300 god 1
@f310 layer 3
@f450 layer 4
@f520 place e0005011b player 15
@f700 fsm e0005011b BecomeDeRezzed
@f800 fsm e0005011b Idle
@f850 fsm e0005011b BecomeRezzed
@f950 fsm e0005011b Idle
@f1000 fsm e0005011b BecomeRezzed
@f1050 fsm e0005011b Idle
@f1100 codecall e0005011b SetDeRezzedState
@f1110 fsm e0005011b BecomeDeRezzed
@f1160 fsm e0005011b Idle
@f1250 spawn REZB
@f1400 kill e0005011b
@f1450 kill e00050065
@f1500 covdump
@f1700 objs rezbit
